          "name": "Sandarac varnish",
          "description": "A traditional resin varnish of sandarac and lavender oil in alcohol, applied warm to protect the image.",
          "inDefinedTermSet": "https://tijdgieterij.nl/ontology/collodion-wetplate#CollodionWetplateOntology/glossary"
        },
        {
          "@type": "DefinedTerm",
          "@id": "https://tijdgieterij.nl/ontology/collodion-wetplate#Sensitivity",
          "name": "Sensitivity",
          "description": "How responsive the plate is to light; collodion is slow and blue/UV sensitive.",
          "inDefinedTermSet": "https://tijdgieterij.nl/ontology/collodion-wetplate#CollodionWetplateOntology/glossary"
        },
        {
